  "limits": [
    "Three Stage4 gates and K02/K03/K04 remain pending; group management is connected, not completion of those rows",
    "Uses existing native full-snapshot comparison and atomic queued persistence; no new IPC or instance/file deletion action",
    "Rename retains ID, color, members and ordering; dissolve explicitly confirmed and preserves every member including unknown editions as ungrouped entries at the original location",
    "Group UI validates trimmed nonempty unique names up to100 characters; legacy native group schema/API remains compatible",
    "Concurrent changes retain the draft and require fresh review; reload resets that draft and selection to the first group",
    "The persisted registry uses relative paths for managed instances and full paths in runtime state; both retained",
